---
// src/components/Testimonials.astro
---

<section class="sec" style="background:var(--black-soft)">
  <div class="rv">
    <div class="sec-label" data-i18n="testimonials.label">Ils nous font confiance</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title" data-i18n-html="testimonials.title">Ce que disent<br>nos clients.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="tsti-grid rv d1">

    <article class="tsti-card" aria-label="Témoignage de Karim M.">
      <div class="stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5" role="img">
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="tsti-txt" data-i18n="testimonials.items.0.text">
        Evolus a transformé notre site en outil de vente. En 3 mois, nos devis ont doublé.
      </blockquote>
      <div class="tsti-auth">
        <div class="ava" aria-hidden="true">KM</div>
        <div>
          <div class="a-name" data-i18n="testimonials.items.0.name">Karim M.</div>
          <div class="a-co"   data-i18n="testimonials.items.0.company">CEO, ArchiDesign Studio</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="tsti-card" aria-label="Témoignage de Sara B.">
      <div class="stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5" role="img">
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="tsti-txt" data-i18n="testimonials.items.1.text">
        Le contenu génère des leads depuis 6 mois sans qu'on lève le petit doigt.
      </blockquote>
      <div class="tsti-auth">
        <div class="ava" aria-hidden="true">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div class="a-name" data-i18n="testimonials.items.1.name">Sara B.</div>
          <div class="a-co"   data-i18n="testimonials.items.1.company">Directrice, FinConsult</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="tsti-card" aria-label="Témoignage de Youssef A.">
      <div class="stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5" role="img">
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="tsti-txt" data-i18n="testimonials.items.2.text">
        +280% de trafic en 4 mois. Ils ont compris notre secteur mieux que personne.
      </blockquote>
      <div class="tsti-auth">
        <div class="ava" aria-hidden="true">YA</div>
        <div>
          <div class="a-name" data-i18n="testimonials.items.2.name">Youssef A.</div>
          <div class="a-co"   data-i18n="testimonials.items.2.company">Fondateur, Medic360</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.tsti-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.2rem;
  margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
}

.tsti-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: clamp(1.5rem, 2vw, 2rem);
  transition:
    border-color var(--dur-mid),
    transform    var(--dur-mid) var(--ease-out);
}
.tsti-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--border-hover);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.stars {
  display: flex;
  gap: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.star {
  width: 11px; height: 11px;
  background: var(--accent);
  display: block;
  clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,61% 35%,98% 35%,68% 57%,79% 91%,50% 70%,21% 91%,32% 57%,2% 35%,39% 35%);
}

.tsti-txt {
  font-size: 0.91rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--white);
  font-weight: 300;
  margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  quotes: none;
}
.tsti-txt::before {
  content: '"';
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  line-height: 0;
  vertical-align: -0.25em;
  margin-right: 0.15em;
}

.tsti-auth {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.65rem;
}

.ava {
  width: 34px; height: 34px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--accent);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--black);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.a-name { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; }
.a-co   { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .tsti-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
